usage: logscan [OPTIONS] PATTERN [FILE...]
options:
  -o, --output FILE  write the report to FILE instead
                     of standard output
  -n, --lines N      show only the first N matching
                     lines (default: 20)
      --color WHEN   colour the output: always, never
                     or auto, where auto colours only
                     when writing to a terminal
                     (default: auto)
  -v, --verbose      explain each step
  -h, --help         show this help and exit
